 0.13131313131313133, "x1": 0.289010989010989, "y1": 0.14918414918414918}, {"text": "(iv) Suppose that in (iii) the parameter s = \u20141/t. Show that the locus of M is a", "x0": 0.15164835164835164, "y0": 0.1592851592851593, "x1": 0.8813186813186813, "y1": 0.17327117327117328}, {"text": "straight line through, but excluding, the origin.", "x0": 0.15054945054945054, "y0": 0.17715617715617715, "x1": 0.5648351648351648, "y1": 0.19036519036519037}, {"text": "(b) Let Cy = 2? + 3y? \u2014 = + y? \u2014 1, and let \\ be a real number.", "x0": 0.15164835164835164, "y0": 0.20046620046620048, "x1": 0.8032967032967033, "y1": 0.216006216006216}, {"text": "(i) Show that C, + AC) = 0 is the equation of a curve through the points of inter-", "x0": 0.15164835164835164, "y0": 0.22766122766122765, "x1": 0.8802197802197802, "y1": 0.24164724164724163}, {"text": "section of the ellipses C = 0 and Cy = 0.", "x0": 0.15054945054945054, "y0": 0.24553224553224554, "x1": 0.512087912087912, "y1": 0.25874125874125875}, {"text": "(ii) Determine the values of \\ for which + = 0 is the equation of an ellips", "x0": 0.15164835164835164, "y0": 0.27117327117327117, "x1": 0.8615384615384616, "y1": 0.28438228438228436}, {"text": "A. (a) 7", "x0": 0.15054945054945054, "y0": 0.3038073038073038, "x1": 0.5098901098901099, "y1": 0.3185703185703186}, {"text": "The diagram is a sketch of the function y = f(z).", "x0": 0.15054945054945054, "y0": 0.49805749805749805, "x1": 0.5835164835164836, "y1": 0.5244755244755245}, {"text": "On separate diagrams sketch:", "x0": 0.15054945054945054, "y0": 0.5322455322455323, "x1": 0.4065934065934066, "y1": 0.5454545454545454}, {"text": "@y=-f@) Gi) y= (iv) y = sin", "x0": 0.15164835164835164, "y0": 0.5571095571095571, "x1": 0.7208791208791209, "y1": 0.5718725718725719}, {"text": ". . \u2014 for x 2 0:", "x0": 0.3208791208791209, "y0": 0.5811965811965812, "x1": 0.7923076923076923, "y1": 0.5951825951825952}, {"text": "(b) The even function g is defined by g(x) =", "x0": 0.151